{"title": "The Guns of Avalon", "pageid": 2056, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 223px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/princeofamber/images/2/20/The_Guns_of_Avalon.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20100805160312\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Author          Roger Zelazny\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/princeofamber/images/2/20/The_Guns_of_Avalon.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/223?cb=20100805160312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"223\" height=\"303\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"The Guns of Avalon.jpg\" data-image-key=\"The_Guns_of_Avalon.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Guns_of_Avalon.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Author          Roger Zelazny</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>The Guns of Avalon is the second book in the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Chronicles_of_Amber\" title=\"The Chronicles of Amber\">Chronicles of Amber</a> series by Roger Zelazny. The book continues straight from the previous volume, <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Princes_in_Amber\" title=\"Nine Princes in Amber\">Nine Princes in Amber</a>, although it includes a recap.\n</p><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fprinceofamber.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Guns_of_Avalon%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Corwin\" title=\"Corwin\">Corwin of Amber</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Oberon\" title=\"Oberon\">Oberon of Amber</a> (as <a href=\"/wiki/Ganelon\" title=\"Ganelon\">Ganelon</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Benedict\" title=\"Benedict\">Benedict of Amber</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dara\" title=\"Dara\">Dara</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Eric\" title=\"Eric\">Eric of Amber</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fprinceofamber.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Guns_of_Avalon%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>After regenerating his eyes and escaping Eric's dungeon in <i>Nine Princes of Amber</i>, Corwin tries to muster a force once more. While gunpowder does not function in Amber, he knows of a substance, <a href=\"/wiki/Jeweler%27s_Rouge\" title=\"Jeweler&#39;s Rouge\">Jeweler's Rouge</a>, that will, and can be used as such. He walks in shadow and by accident meets <a href=\"/wiki/Ganelon\" title=\"Ganelon\">Ganelon</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Oberon\" title=\"Oberon\">or rather, who he <i>believes</i> is Ganelon...)</a>, a man who he exiled while ruling a shadow world known as <span class=\"new\" title=\"Avalon (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXZhbG9uP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Avalon</span> (probably a parody of the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avalon\">legendary island</a>). They join forces against strange forces who are attacking the land over which <a href=\"/wiki/Ganelon\" title=\"Ganelon\">Ganelon</a> rules. They find <a href=\"/wiki/Benedict\" title=\"Benedict\">Benedict</a>, ruling over a <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">shadow</a> of Avalon, and <a href=\"/wiki/Dara\" title=\"Dara\">Dara</a>, future mother of <a href=\"/wiki/Corwin\" title=\"Corwin\">Corwin</a>'s son, <a href=\"/wiki/Merlin\" title=\"Merlin\">Merlin</a>. They leave the shadow-Avalon, but Benedict pursues them, in a fit of rage, accusing them of the murder of his servants, whose bodies Corwin and Ganelon found the day before their departure. Benedict is knocked unconcious, and Corwin calls on Gerard to help him. Later, they discover a strange <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Road\" title=\"Black Road\">Black Road</a> stretching towards Amber. They find <a href=\"/wiki/Jeweler%27s_Rouge\" title=\"Jeweler&#39;s Rouge\">Jeweler's Rouge</a>, and muster their forces in one final attack on Amber (Corwin's previous attempt with <a href=\"/wiki/Bleys\" title=\"Bleys\">Bleys</a> having failed). Ganelon helps him (Oberon having previously voiced his support for Corwin when Corwin managed to contact him via his trump in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Princes_in_Amber\" title=\"Nine Princes in Amber\">Nine Princes of Amber</a></i>), and they win, Corwin taking the <a href=\"/wiki/Jewel_of_Judgement\" title=\"Jewel of Judgement\">Jewel of Judgement</a> from Eric's dead breast. Later, they find Dara walking the pattern, succeeding, and naming herself an enemy of Amber.\n</p><p>See also: \n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"C